              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Will sealer stop my joint sand from washing into the pool?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Yes — film-forming and joint-stabilizing sealers bind the joint sand into a firm matrix so it stops eroding into the pool and filter. Penetrating sealers don't lock joint sand, so if washout is your main issue, choose an acrylic or a dedicated joint stabilizer and make sure joints are fully sanded first.
